  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3209.03 General Accounts",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3209.03 General Accounts.\n\n(a) The NATS administrator shall allow for the establishment of general accounts.\n\n(b) Any person or group may open a general account by designating an AAR and providing the NATS administrator with an “Account Certificate of Representation” in accordance with Env-A 3209.04 and Env-A 3209.05, respectively.\n\nSource. #11001, eff 1-1-16; ss by #14632, eff 6-25-26, EXPIRES: 6-25-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a3200.html"
